  Kinetic (Delta T^0):                   0.880089452545804         23.9485           552.26          2310.67
  Delta V^Pauli Coulomb:                -0.349204724420994         -9.5023          -219.13          -916.84
  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.197615933649595         -5.3774          -124.01          -518.84
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.035930715895363          0.9777            22.55            94.34
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Correlation:        -0.030814649745085         -0.8385           -19.34           -80.90
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
  Total Pauli Repulsion:                 0.338384860625493          9.2079           212.34           888.43
 (Total Pauli Repulsion =
  Delta E^Pauli in BB paper)

